{"id":"vod_lz_107957","vodId":"107957","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"吊带袜天使","name_cn":"吊带袜天使","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20250716-1/6c8f3d1713e1a30426ece7cbfcac356b.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一座名为堕天城的城市之中，它夹在天堂和地狱之间，是一座充满了危险和奇遇的城市。近日来，城市里出现了邪恶的恶灵，他们依靠袭击市民们为生，这令市民们人心惶惶人人自危。                                    \r\n                                　　Panty（小笠原亚里沙 配音）和Stocking（伊濑茉莉也 配音）本是两位天使，却因为他们桀骜不驯的作风而被逐出了天堂，来到了堕天城。在这里，姐妹两人遇见了名为Garterbelt（石井康嗣 配音）的神父，在这位拥有着神秘过去的神父的带领下，Panty和Stocking成为了恶灵狩猎者，通过狩猎恶灵得到天堂金币，当天堂金币积攒到了一定的数量之时，Panty和Stocking便可以借此重新返回天堂。就这样，两人在堕天城的日常就此拉开了序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-07-16 12:35:48","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250714/24327_0786e0a8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250714/24329_909e382c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250714/24331_4a8638a9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250714/24333_63f55f14/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250714/24334_d59dcc8b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250714/24335_e7190147/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250714/24337_4335a869/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250714/24339_20fb2cd9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250714/24340_70b19792/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250714/24342_479d08f3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250714/24343_2eb3db87/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250714/24344_cf6910e0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.lzcdn26.com/20250714/24346_0d063060/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:1